message:
{{#is_alert}}Nestswipe could not read a listing after its configured retries and browser fallback. Open the matching logs and check listing_source, listing_host, reason, http_status, and error_type. Check proxy connectivity and the seloger-browser service for SeLoger challenges.{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}No final listing-access failures were observed in the last 15 minutes. This is a quiet window, not an active probe of each provider.{{/is_recovery}}

Covers email and manual imports from all listing sources. Expected HTTP 404/410 removals and successfully recovered browser challenges do not trigger this monitor. Photo filtering and LLM extraction errors are separate from listing access.

After fixing an outage, replay affected emails with backend/scripts/reprocess_emails.py using a bounded time window or specific email IDs.
